    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1675">

                <pb facs="1064" n="948" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg948"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/689.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Diaz to the
                            President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 2, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Informed by the United States Minister, Doctor Jefferson, of the best personal
                    efforts of yourself and Mr. Bryan to relieve our distressing condition, I beg
                    Your Excellency kindly to accept my cordial thanks together with the expression
                    of my firm confidence in the success of your good and deeply appreciated
                    endeavors in behalf of Nicaragua.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Adolfo Díaz</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
